  "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Harmful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a man speaking at a podium with Spanish and EU flags, overlaid with text reading 'how they see' and 'how i see'. The visual juxtaposition implies a contrast between an official, formal perspective and a personal, possibly critical or mocking one. While the image does not contain explicit hate speech or targeted abuse against any protected group, the meme format can be interpreted as potentially harmful due to its implication of a distorted or biased perception. The 'how i see' text suggests a subjective, possibly negative or dismissive viewpoint, which may be used to undermine the legitimacy or seriousness of the speaker or the event. This can contribute to a hostile or dismissive atmosphere, especially if the meme is used to delegitimize official statements or institutions. The overall intent is to provoke a reaction by contrasting perceived authority with personal interpretation, which may be seen as undermining trust in institutions or creating division.",
